&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3PGIzv0TCWk4v7yJtqnvMnLA78XlPn_fV3DqV9hLNb4A&oe=69E4C55B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TZPnQmvgfHkQ7kNvwEzYC0Q&_nc_oc=AdrFKEAi8R8uQDSrK-RZWr09Byk5FK9CvFbmbF0QO_yVZ9IC5PSM84zssC-4ouQO5ns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0NE-wIwdn4zPDw8B-At8EE9JzhJWzY62RJow7M5b4gxQ&oe=69E4EDE1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I-9wAeqMWigQ7kNvwFBnDiZ&_nc_oc=Adow60YtorVr3RfjOFqj6mgn6B5jnoJuQsNdrgJsTcgaJuEHZa8ZLKHXMnmy2Xb3BGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0nN08yM7bJ-nMx7eNWEGkZTbXevPfT4PQws7CHsEQBDQ&oe=69E4DAAF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nvxAv_quHFEQ7kNvwG_1QnQ&_nc_oc=Adp7ornAEG7Ybcu_DS9w_v8G6Ais9pXUy8muQ1eeqJgtEVhPHCWrMbrPB30w9aG60Cs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af37b7pkqAGJhRKD8i24ytLVXflOdbpCYKyXHzms0BXAfQ&oe=69E4DA52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DlSAu2GajXUQ7kNvwG9FGSI&_nc_oc=AdoLZfuLEyXFhKUCSQx6B3rYg2JFB694z2s3zJM07QQ-tEBXMWxekSsoGSCd8s8flZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2v_UF3qcX2jGb_XN3fHtFWFBYDGdkxOvD2UnTztI70VA&oe=69E4E3FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.artisoft.pl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED